{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "latam", "appid": 924970, "month": "2024-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1717200000, "end_date": 1719791999, "month_true_total": 30, "quota": 30, "returned": 30, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:56:28 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "168556842", "author": {"steamid": "76561198385048596", "personaname": "Ashe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198385048596/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 3810, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1475, "last_played": 1733298751, "avatar": "03b31ea803eb0fda2cc398f55fa8f3e0e7cb091d"}, "language": "latam", "review": "El juego es genial, los escenarios son variados y tienen una alta re jugabilidad. El sistema de cartas es lo mejor del juego, ofrece una enorme gama de personalización que se adapta a cualquier estilo de juego. El único aspecto negativo del juego es el precio. Sin embargo, a veces puedes encontrar ofertas muy buenas.", "timestamp_created": 1719721373, "timestamp_updated": 1719721373, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52267301082611084", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168517297", "author": {"steamid": "76561198103957398", "personaname": "꧁༒☬Crowley☬༒ৡ꧂", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198103957398/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 4939, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1202, "playtime_at_review": 533, "last_played": 1788044429, "avatar": "2a0f136017676565bd95f771e52107686dba5310"}, "language": "latam", "review": "buen juego", "timestamp_created": 1719683741, "timestamp_updated": 1719683741, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168404021", "author": {"steamid": "76561198096712427", "personaname": "WindNayru", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/WindNayru/", "num_games_owned": 248, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 4848, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 825, "last_played": 1782055308, "avatar": "3aa3a7c6f737cc46179471dad3c618eed625ac7b"}, "language": "latam", "review": "La historia queda bastante de lado que puedes pasar disparando y matando que no te enteras de que va, es un poco más complicado que left 4 dead con el sistema de cartas y personajes, frustrante que si pierdes más de 1 vez no puedes continuar en el punto de control, y que si te caes o te empujan a un charquito de agua te mueres instantáneamente, fuera de eso bastante bueno y más con amigos, si el lider del grupo tiene los DLC, todos los demás pueden jugar con esos agregados, considero que con descuento vale la pena, sin descuento es demasiado caro", "timestamp_created": 1719580027, "timestamp_updated": 1719580027, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168393100", "author": {"steamid": "76561198337049526", "personaname": "whisma", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Whisma1/", "num_games_owned": 224, "num_reviews": 61, "playtime_forever": 980, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 971, "last_played": 1719572759, "avatar": "1959f1b520bdbb3f80ef710c9a45129d87e358ea"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Bu